# Build context is `backend/`. Without this file every build uploads the full obj/ and bin/ trees
# plus a 92 KB spec document — and stale obj/ artifacts from a Windows host can poison a Linux
# restore inside the image.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Docs are not inputs to the build.
*.md
**/*.md

# Never reachable from the Dockerfile, but keep them out of the context regardless.
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/secrets.json
